## State Testing

- Test state equality
- Verify state transitions
- Mock state scenarios
- State change assertions
- Isolated state testing

```dart
// Testing state equality
test('states with same data are equal', () {
  const state1 = SuccessState<String>('data');
  const state2 = SuccessState<String>('data');
