});
```

## UI State Integration

- Reactive UI updates
- State-based widget building
- Conditional rendering patterns
- State change animations
- Error state UI handling

```dart
// UI state integration
Widget buildContent(FeatureState state) {
  return switch (state) {
    LoadingState() => const LoadingWidget(),
    SuccessState<List<Contact>>() => ContactList(state.data),
    ErrorState() => ErrorWidget(state.message),
    EmptyState() => const EmptyStateWidget(),
    _ => const SizedBox.shrink(),
  };
}
```

